    "title": "West Haven urges residents to stay inside as storm threats loom along coast - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Logan Perrone ,\n21 hours ago WEST HAVEN, Conn. (WFSB) - City leaders in West Haven are taking an all-hands-on-deck approach to this weekend’s nor’easter, hoping to prevent as much damage and disruption as they can. West Haven’s Emergency Operation Center is active and will continue to monitor the storm throughout the weekend. Read full article",
